  "summary": "<p>Today, the Trump Administration unleashed Operation Economic Outcast, an unprecedented campaign to sever every remaining economic lifeline sustaining the Islamic Republic of Iran. After President Trump and the overwhelming might of the U.S. military dismantled Iran’s military capabilities and crippled its nuclear program, America is entering the endgame with the single greatest financial offensive ever [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/operation-economic-outcast-total-isolation-of-the-iranian-regime/\">Operation Economic Outcast: Total Isolation of the Iranian Regime</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
